        "legacy_id": "625896f7-6680-4328-96d7-b7f76896f369",
        "name": "Jason O'Quinn",
        "slug": "jason-o-quinn",
        "title": "Founder & CEO",
        "biography": "<p>Jason started Petra nearly two decades ago with a sincere passion for helping people. Voted one of D Magazine’s Best Mortgage Professionals year after year, Jason really gets the mortgage industry. But that’s not why people choose Jason for their home lending needs. His integrity, commitment, and personal touch are what make him the best at what he does; it comes as no surprise that most of his clients come back over and over because of his willingness to serve them well.</p>",
        "headshot_url": "/images/jo.jpg",
        "nmls_number": "293991",
        "phone": "",
        "email": "jason@petralending.com",
        "quote_text": "",
        "application_url": "https://jasonoquinn.zipforhome.com",
        "published": true,
        "sort_order": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "values": {
        "legacy_id": "85bf1552-a595-4156-a053-0f216bf0074f",
        "name": "Kyle Kisselburg",
        "slug": "kyle-kisselburg",
        "title": "Vice President",
        "biography": "<p>With 20 years of home lending experience, Kyle helps Petra lead the charge in excellent customer experiences. More likely to call rather than text, Kyle knows exactly what his clients expect and always delivers his best. Maybe that’s because he was raised in Tulsa, and people from Tulsa are super smart, and super nice, and super great mortgage lenders. Yeah, that’s it.</p>",
        "headshot_url": "/images/kk.jpg",
