    {
      "values": {
        "legacy_id": "888b2e50-9e2e-4915-b386-1e8511ec3bdc",
        "name": "Kevin Russell",
        "slug": "kevin-russell",
        "title": "Senior Loan Officer",
        "biography": "<p>Kevin comes with 25 years of experience in the real estate and lending industry. He resides with his sweet family in Dallas where he enjoys good eating, spending time with those he loves, and anything cars! Kevin makes every client a priority by offering “boutique service”, transparency, and honesty. He knows that financing a home can come with its challenges and wants to serve each client by making their experience as stress-free and seamless as possible</p>",
        "headshot_url": "/images/kr.jpg",
