    {
      "values": {
        "legacy_id": "a762b009-1af2-4131-9c0a-7f8937f91f0e",
        "name": "Mary Russell",
        "slug": "mary-russell",
        "title": "Senior Loan Officer",
        "biography": "<p>With 20 years’ experience in just about every corner of the mortgage business, Mary really has what it takes to make sure your home buying experience is second to none. Mary’s clients, many of whom she has worked with for 10+ years, will say that she is dedicated, extremely responsive, and available after hours, on the weekends and even vacation (what?!). She does it all while raising 3 kids and keeping active with her church. I’d call that a super power. What’s yours?</p>",
        "headshot_url": "/images/mr.jpg",
