    {
      "values": {
        "legacy_id": "bb383736-553e-45f0-8706-f70b404480fd",
        "name": "Joshua Hernandez",
        "slug": "joshua-hernandez",
        "title": "Senior Loan Officer",
        "biography": "<p>With nearly 20 years of experience as a loan originator, Joshua makes it a priority to build trusting relationships with each of his clients so he can serve them best. His communication skills and attention to detail are supported by the nearly 100 5- star reviews he has received online from satisfied clients. He’s also the co-founder of Impossible Possibilities – an education non-profit that has awarded $250,000 in college scholarships to students in Dallas and Tarrant county.</p>",
